penalty of perjury, or sworn to before a person authorized to administer oaths, setting forth
such information concerning the applicant's business during the preceding year as may be
required by the license tax official to enable him or her to ascertain the amount of business
tax to be paid by the applicant pursuant to the provisions of this title.
