§ 5.04.220. Failure to file statement or corrected statement- Determination of amount of
business tax.
A. If any person fails to file any required statement within the time prescribed, or if after
demand therefor made by the license tax official, such person fails to file a corrected
statement, the license tax official may determine the amount of business tax due from
