and which such tax certificate is currently suspended or revoked pursuant to this section
shall be deemed guilty of a misdemeanor and, upon conviction thereof, shall be
punished by a fine not exceeding $1,000.00, or by imprisonment in jail for a period not
exceeding six months, or by both such fine and imprisonment. Each and every day in
which any person continues to engage in such activity shall constitute a separate offense.
