§ 5.04.300. Business tax-How and when payable.
A. Unless otherwise specifically provided, all businesstaxesfor taxcertificates issued between
January 1st and June 30th under the provisions of this title shall be due and payable in
advance on the first day of January each year; all business taxes for licenses issued
between July 1st and December 31st under the provisions of this title shall be due and
