any place of business required to be licensed herein, and demand an exhibition of its tax
certificate. Any person having such tax certificate theretofore issued, in his or her
possession or under his or her control, who fails to exhibit the same on demand, shall be
guilty of a misdemeanor and subject to the penalties provided for by the Upland
Municipal Code.
§ 5.04.330. Business tax a debt.
The amount of any business tax and penalty imposed by the provisions of this title shall be
deemed a debt to the city. An action may be commenced in the city in any court of competent
