information it contains and will not prevent the city from collecting the appropriate amount
which is actually due and payable, and shall be subject to audit and verification. The
license official shall have the authority to examine or cause to examine, audit, and inspect
such books and records as may be necessary to determine the amount of tax due and
payable, and shall have the authority to enforce all provisions of this section as set forth
